WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.900 --> 00:00:02.202
-The last time I saw you,

00:00:02.202 --> 00:00:03.670
you were telling me about
buying stuff for your baby,

00:00:03.670 --> 00:00:05.171
