of other countries?

00:04:26.399 --> 00:04:27.634 size:81% position:41%
-I´m like, I thank God

00:04:27.634 --> 00:04:29.669
that we don´t all
speak English around the world.

00:04:29.669 --> 00:04:30.937 align:start size:94% position:6%
[ Laughter ]

00:04:30.937 --> 00:04:32.839 align:start size:94% position:6%
You don´t understand
what a difference it makes.

00:04:32.839 --> 00:04:34.540 align:start size:94% position:6%
Like, I remember traveling
to the Middle East,

00:04:34.540 --> 00:04:36.175 align:start size:94% position:6%
and I was like,
"Aren´t you guys terrified?

00:04:36.175 --> 00:04:37.377 align:start size:94% position:6%
Like, he´s loud,
and he´s crazy."

00:04:37.377 --> 00:04:39.145
And they´re like, "Oh, no."

00:04:39.145 --> 00:04:40.446 align:start size:94% position:6%
People are like,
"It just sounds like

00:04:40.446 --> 00:04:41.914
he´s speaking Arabic in English.
That is all."

00:04:41.914 --> 00:04:43.182 align:start size:94% position:6%
[ Laughter ]

00:04:43.182 --> 00:04:45.585
Because, like, Arabic is like...
[ Speaking Arabic ]

00:04:45.585 --> 00:04:46.753 align:start size:94% position:6%
...and then Donald Trump
is like...

00:04:46.753 --> 00:04:48.788
[ Speaking gibberish loudly ]

00:04:48.788 --> 00:04:52.925
And people are just like, "Oh!"
It´s, like, "Yeah, I get it."

00:04:52.925 --> 00:04:54.460 align:start size:94% position:6%
It´s a cultural thing.
-Yeah.

00:04:54.460 --> 00:04:56.195 align:start size:94% position:6%
-I don´t think you understand
how cultural it is.

00:04:56.195 --> 00:04:57.830 align:start size:94% position:6%
Like, you travel
around the world,

00:04:57.830 --> 00:05:00.033
