the nuances.

00:05:03.670 --> 00:05:05.505 align:start size:94% position:6%
In English,
he´s completely bonkers.

00:05:05.505 --> 00:05:06.906 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah.
-Right?

00:05:06.906 --> 00:05:09.242
Once you translate him,
