00:05:10.777 --> 00:05:12.478 align:start size:94% position:6%
Not all, but half.

00:05:12.478 --> 00:05:14.080 align:start size:94% position:6%
-We should, every morning,
translate him

00:05:14.080 --> 00:05:15.248 size:88% position:44%
